{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:32:36.722Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"576d1520f1583a4a8e9d68ed2bd941054db4f7501a3f92632aa69bceff9fc111","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Bettina, here's what I found for Kwame's review. Sources: #coastal-team, #coastal-random and Moss's Coastal digests/cheat sheet.\n\nPELLUCID HARBOR LOGISTICS (Gulf Coast)\n- Ticket #4419: Yard_Dwell_Summary report times out when filtered by container length. Open. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n- Not numbered: chassis pool validation friction at Gate 4 during shift change. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n\nDRIFTMOOR MARINE FREIGHT (Puget Sound)\n- Feature request #882: bulk-clear button for departed barges, asked for by their warehouse managers. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n- Ticket #4419: barge slip 7 schedule sync; DMF asked for a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift. (Moss's 2025-11-02 digest)\n- Not numbered: tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B; engineering gave a manual CSV patch for the night dispatcher. (Coastal cheat sheet)\n\nCheck before you use it: #4419 appears under both accounts with different descriptions (PHL report timeout in the cheat sheet, DMF slip 7 sync in the Nov 2025 digest). I can't tell which is right, or whether it's two tickets sharing a number. Kwame should confirm it.\n\nAlso, your own note from 2025-12-08 mentions ticket #PD-8841 for PHL (chassis pool holds on double-booked gates, Gate 4B), plus a CSV import bug on the Berth 2 yard map with no ticket number. That's outside the sources you named, so I've kept it separate.\n\nLeft out as Pellow Home Living / Covey & Lark: #8812 and PD-4821. Also left out as Saltmarsh: PD-4824 and PD-4827. Nothing for either of your two accounts turned up in #coastal-random.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
